  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arab Partnership Economic Facility (APEF): Contributions to World Bank Multi Donor Trust Fund to support reforming countries in the Middle East and North Africa (MENA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Arab Partnership Economic Facility (APEF): Contributions to World Bank Multi Donor Trust Fund to support reforming countries in the Middle East and North Africa (MENA) is a component of Arab Partnership Economic Facility (APEF) - World Bank MENA Trust Funds reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;5,000,000. This project benefits Middle East, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Public sector policy and administrative management, Public finance management (PFM), Business policy and administration, Research/scientific institutions, Sectors not specified, Trade policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
